   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **Note:** Some Markdown explanations in this notebook were translated with the help of AI."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ff2ea18b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Confidence Interval Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "- In this part, we used confidence intervals for numerical columns.\n",
    "- The goal was to estimate the possible population mean based on our sample.\n",
    "\n",
    "- We used confidence intervals for variables such as:\n",
    "  - `Anxiety Level (1-10)`\n",
    "  - `Stress Level (1-10)`\n",
    "  - `Sleep Hours`\n",
    "  - `Caffeine Intake (mg/day)`\n",
    "  - `Physical Activity (hrs/week)`\n",
    "\n",
    "- A confidence interval gives a range of likely values for the true population mean.\n",
    "- For example, instead of reporting only the sample mean of anxiety level, we reported a 95% confidence interval.\n",
    "\n",
    "- This makes the result more informative because it also shows uncertainty."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 430,
   "id": "04bdca30",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def mean_ci(data, column, confidence=0.95):\n",
    "    \n",
    "    x = data[column]\n",
    "    n = len(x)\n",
    "    mean = x.mean()\n",
    "    std = x.std(ddof=1)\n",
    "    se = std / np.sqrt(n)\n",
    "\n",
    "    alpha = 1 - confidence\n",
    "    t_critical = stats.t.ppf(1 - alpha / 2, df=n - 1)\n",
    "\n",
    "    margin_error = t_critical * se\n",
    "    lower = mean - margin_error\n",
    "    upper = mean + margin_error\n",
    "\n",
    "    result = pd.DataFrame({\n",
    "        \"Variable\": [column],\n",
    "        \"Type\": \"Mean CI\",\n",
    "        \"N\": n,\n",
    "        \"Sample Mean\": round(mean, 3),\n",
    "        \"Sample Std\": round(std, 3),\n",
    "        \"Confidence Level\": confidence,\n",
    "        \"CI Lower\": round(lower, 3),\n",
    "        \"CI Upper\": round(upper, 3),\n",
    "    })\n",
    "\n",
    "    return result"
   ]
  },
