    "### compare two categorical\n",
    "This analysis examines whether there is a statistically significant association between two categorical variables using the Chi-Square Test of Independence.\n",
    "- Null Hypothesis (H₀):** The two categorical variables are independent. There is no significant association between them.\n",
    "- Alternative Hypothesis (H₁):** The two categorical variables are not independent. There is a significant association between them.\n",
    "- If **p-value < 0.05**, reject the null hypothesis (H₀).\n",
    "- If **p-value ≥ 0.05**, fail to reject the null hypothesis (H₀)."
   ]
  },
